{title: Kalyana Then Nila}
{artist: Ilaiyaraaja Yesudas Chithra}
{key: Dm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Dm] Kalyana thaen nila [C] aa,        Kaai [Am] chaatha paal nil [Dm] aa
[Dm] Nee thaanae vaan nil [C] aa,        Enn [Am] odu vaa ni [Dm] la
Theiya [C] atha vennila,        Un ka [Am] adhal kaannila
Aaga [C] ayam [F] mannil [C] aaa [Dm] a,        [Dm] Kalyana thaen nila [C] aa
Kaai [Am] chaatha paal nil [Dm] aa,        [Dm] Thenpaandi koodala
Dheva [Am] ara paad [Dm] ala,        Thee [Am] raadha ood [F] ala
Thaen [C] sindhum koo [Dm] dala,        [Dm] En anbu kaadhal [C] aa
[Am] Ennaalum kooda [Dm] la,        [Dm] Perinbam meiyi [C] la
[Am] Nee theendum kaiyi [Dm] la,        [Dm] Paarppomae aavalaa
Vaa [C] vaa nila?aaaa [Dm] a,        [Dm] Un dhegam thaekkila
Thaen [Am] undhan vaakil [Dm] aa,        Un paa [Am] rvai thoon [F] dila
Naan [C] kaidhi koond [Dm] ila,        [Dm] Sangeetham paatti [C] la
[Am] Nee pesum pechi [Dm] la,        [Dm] En jeevan enni [C] la
Un [Am] paarvai thann [Dm] ila,        [Dm] Thaen oorum vaer pala
Un soll [C] ila?aaaaa [Dm] aaaaa,        Kalyana thaen nila
Kaaichaatha paal nila,        Nee thaanae vaan nilaa
Ennodu vaa nila,        Theiyaatha vennila
Un kaadhal kaannila,        Aagaayam mannila?aaaa?
Kalyana thaen nila,        Kaichaatha paal nila
